{"ref":"BDB, סָרָה","hw":"סָרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סָרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. a turning aside, defection, apostasy, withdrawal</strong>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>defection</em>, used appar. of any moral or legal offence <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.16\">Dt 19:16</a>, so prob. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.13\">Is 59:13</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבְרֵי שָׁ֑קֶר</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>apostasy</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.6\">Dt 13:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.5\">Is 1:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.6\">31:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.16\">Je 28:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.32\">29:32</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלְתִּי סָרָה</span> <em>non-withdrawal</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.6\">Is 14:6</a> (cf. vb., v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:7\" href=\"/Amos.6.7\">Am 6:7</a>).","next":"BDB, סִרָה","prev":"BDB, סוּר³"}